# Security

Apply least privilege to all integrations.

Required controls:

- Verify webhook signatures
- Validate LiveKit tokens and participant permissions
- Enforce call-scope on internal voice APIs when `REQUIRE_CALL_SCOPE=true` (production must set this)
- Scope all tenant data by server-derived `tenant_id` (never trust client tenant alone)
- Sanitize external input
- Restrict tool access and rate-limit public endpoints
- Prevent prompt injection from retrieved documents and external content
- Separate trusted system instructions from untrusted user content
- Do not execute arbitrary code, SQL, URLs, or shell commands generated by the model
- Redact sensitive data from logs
- Use HTTPS and secure WebSocket connections
- Keep object storage private; tenant-prefixed keys only
- Define transcript and recording retention rules
